<title>DENMARK: Danish ISS takes over Norwegian cleaner.</title>
<headline>Danish ISS takes over Norwegian cleaner.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cleaning and service group International Service System A/S(ISS) said on Wednesday its ISS Norway unit took over the entire shareholding in Norwegian Telemark-Vestfold Renhold cleaning company.</p>
<p>No purchase sum was given but ISS said the Norwegian cleaner had an annual turnover of 26 million Norwegian crowns.</p>
<p>ISS Norway has an annual turnover of 1.3 billion Norwegian crowns, with 6,000 employees.</p>
<p>ISS said in a statement that the takeover was designed to strengthen ISS' position in the Norwegian market.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
